p onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) +; especially <bdbheb>שׁבט</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <highlight>half a tribe</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 32:33\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,33)\">Num 32:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,13)\">Num 34:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,14)\">Num 34:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 34:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,15)\">Num 34:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) +; half of people <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,3)\">2Sam 18:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:41\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,41)\">2Sam 19:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,21)\">1Kgs 16:21</ref> (3 t. in verse) +, etc. so <bdbheb>הַמְּנֻחוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:52\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,52)\">1Chr 2:52</ref> and <bdbheb>הַמָּנַחְתִּי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 2:54\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"54\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"54\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,54)\">1Chr 2:54</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> and <bdbheb>מָנַחַת</bdbheb> below <bdbheb>נוח</bdbheb>). — On <bdbheb>כבחצי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,4)\">1Sam 14:4</ref> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>middle</highlight> <bdbheb>הלילה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb>